{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國外交部長讓-諾埃爾·巴羅（Jean-Noël Barrot）周二表示，對於10月針對法國超市冰箱發動的大規模網絡攻擊，法國政府「不會排除任何應對措施」。法國已將此次襲擊歸咎於伊朗。周二上午，法國政府召見伊朗駐法大使。此前，巴黎方面周一表示，調查結果認定，此次網絡攻擊由伊朗伊斯蘭革命衞隊網絡部門下屬組織沙希德·卡韋（Shahid Kaveh）實施。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585812.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T15:02:16.771765+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:55:39.623274+00:00","content_hash":"a61dc154ef1b03aafa6e9d5929d51be1419be1cc692a0468d939ecdd41ee1447","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}